-- Some research fields have changed categories (e.g. Railgun tech; see change log for details)
-- It might be a good idea to cancel any research projects in those fields before converting.
--
-- Existing "Beam Fire Control..." components will NOT be renamed to "Direct Fire Control..."
-- The name is only cosmetic.
--
-- Names with special characters have been removed from naming themes.
-- If you have added new naming themes and you do not want them to be removed , you should delete all the lines referring to DIM_NamingTheme (roughly lines 198 to 32450)
--
-- Two new hull types have been added. 
-- I removed the changes from the script, to preserve my own custom hull types.
-- After converting, you can manually add the two hull types if you like:
-- Description		Abbrev
-- Exodus		Exo
-- Monitoring Station 	MNS
-- NOTE: the internal IDs for these hulls will not match the original database; future conversions of this database may cause mismatches

-- v2: NamingTheme changes commented out


-- skoormit needs this line because he has custom views in his database that reference some of the tables being altered
-- if you do not, you can comment out this line
PRAGMA legacy_alter_table = 1; 


